email.content:
Hei {$DATA.first_name|capitalize},

Vi er glade for å informere deg om at ordrenummer {$DATA.cart_order_id} nå er fullført. Hvis du bestilte fysiske varer, bør de snart være hos deg.
{if !empty($DATA.ship_tracking)}
Spor bestillingen din:
{$DATA.ship_tracking}
{/if}

Takk for bestillingen din, {$DATA.first_name|capitalize}.

Vi har mottatt din ordre {$DATA.cart_order_id}, lagt inn den {$DATA.order_date}. Vennligst ta vare på denne e-posten for dine egne notater. Du kan se ordrestatusen din på nettet når som helst.

{$DATA.link}

----------------------------------------------------------------------
Fakturaadresse:
{$BILLING.first_name|capitalize} {$BILLING.last_name|capitalize}
{if !empty($BILLING.company_name)}{$BILLING.company_name}
{/if}{$BILLING.line1|capitalize}
{if !empty($BILLING.line2)}{$BILLING.line2|capitalize}
{/if}{$BILLING.town|upper}
{if !empty($BILLING.state)}{$BILLING.state|upper}
{/if}{$BILLING.postcode}
{$BILLING.country}{if !empty($BILLING.w3w)}
///{$BILLING.w3w}{/if}
{$BILLING.phone}

E-post:
{$BILLING.email}

Leveringsadresse:
{$SHIPPING.first_name|capitalize} {$SHIPPING.last_name|capitalize}
{if !empty($SHIPPING.company_name)}{$SHIPPING.company_name}
{/if}{$SHIPPING.line1|capitalize}
{if !empty($SHIPPING.line2)}{$SHIPPING.line2|capitalize}
{/if}{$SHIPPING.town|upper}
{if !empty($SHIPPING.state)}{$SHIPPING.state|upper}
{/if}{$SHIPPING.postcode}
{$SHIPPING.country}{if !empty($SHIPPING.w3w)}
///{$SHIPPING.w3w}{/if}

----------------------------------------------------------------------
Varer i din bestilling

{foreach from=$PRODUCTS item=product}
-----------------------------------
{$product.name}
{$product.product_options}

Varenummer: {$product.product_code}
Enhetspris: {$product.price}
Antall: {$product.quantity}

{/foreach}
-----------------------------------
Delsum: {$DATA.subtotal}
Rabatt: {$DATA.discount}
{if !empty($DATA.ship_method)}{$DATA.ship_method}:{if !empty($DATA.ship_product)} ({$DATA.ship_product}){/if}{else}Frakt:{/if} {$DATA.shipping}
{foreach from=$TAXES item=tax}{$tax.tax_name} ({$tax.tax_percent}%): {$tax.tax_amount}
{/foreach}{if $DATA.show_credit}
Kreditt: ({$DATA.credit_used})
{/if}--------------------------
Ordretotal: {$DATA.total}
==========================
